    <item>
      <title>**SHOW NOTES**

 The $70 Billion AI Power Grab: ByteDance, SoftBank, and the Energy Crunch.</title>
      <description>Today, we dissect the AI capital race: ByteDance and SoftBank are scrambling for $70 billion combined, while Alphabet spends $4.75B just to secure energy infrastructure. We tackle OpenAI’s warning that prompt injection may never be solved in agentic AI, discuss the chaos caused by autonomous vehicles in a power outage, and analyze why the Roomba hype bubble finally burst into Chapter 11 bankruptcy.</description>
